::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
forest_study(c1_os, studies_df, "Overall Survival", "C1: PTCy vs CNI+MTX/MMF")
```

::: {.cell-output-display}
![Forest plot — Overall survival, C1.](forest-plots_files/figure-html/fig-forest-c1-os-1.svg){#fig-forest-c1-os}
